cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data set, please cite it as below. The DOI always resolves
  to the latest version; to cite a fixed version, use that release's version
  DOI from the Zenodo page. If you use operational data, also cite the study
  listed under references.
type: dataset
title: >-
  Gunnerus Open Data Set: drawings, 3D model, metadata and operational data
  of the research vessel R/V Gunnerus
abstract: >-
  Production drawings (DWG, DXF and A0 PDF), a 3D CAD model, engineering
  documents, structured metadata and operational data for the NTNU research
  vessel R/V Gunnerus, published openly as a reference ship case for
  research, teaching, benchmarking and the development of digital
  shipbuilding tools. Drawings and design data courtesy of polarkonsult;
  derivative drawings, 3D model and engineering documents by C-JOB and NTNU;
  published by NTNU. The operational wave-shielding case is from Wang et al.
  (2025), Ocean Engineering 320, 120189.
